        "y3": {
          "type": "layer",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Outer layer",
            "role": "Wear surface",
            "body": "<p>A tough knit that takes the rubbing inside your boot, so the membrane doesn’t have to. It’s also what keeps the sock in shape.</p>",
